# Values beginning with "AUTHOR-DECISION:" are placeholders for decisions of
# the author; replace them before publication (the license must then be an
# SPDX identifier for this file to validate).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this formalization, please cite it as below, and cite the paper
  it formalizes for the mathematics.
type: software
title: >-
  BKT asymptotics for the quenched free energy of hierarchical pinning:
  Lean 4 formalization
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the paper "BKT asymptotics for the
  quenched free energy of hierarchical pinning" (version of 19 November
  2026): all 24 numbered results, including the
  Berezinskii-Kosterlitz-Thouless asymptotics of the free energy near the
  critical point under a strict shift, with an explicit constant. The Lean
  code was produced by AI models (see README.md and FORMALIZATION_REPORT.md).
authors:
  - given-names: Igor
    family-names: Kortchemski
version: 0.1.0
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "AUTHOR-DECISION: public repository URL"
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalization
  - disordered pinning
  - diamond hierarchical lattice
  - BKT transition
references:
  - type: unpublished
    title: >-
      BKT asymptotics for the quenched free energy of hierarchical pinning
    authors:
      - given-names: Igor
        family-names: Kortchemski
    year: 2026
    notes: >-
      Version of 19 November 2026, not yet distributed. The formalization
      was developed against the draft of 18 November 2026, then titled "BKT
      asymptotics for disordered pinning on the diamond hierarchical
      lattice". arXiv
      identifier: AUTHOR-DECISION: arXiv identifier once the paper is posted.
